# Component/flow view of unimplemented qualification, no native or target evidence.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Independent required inventory\nWhole contract cross product, classified before construction\nMissing schema-valid cases must refuse" {class: start}
Inputs: "Frozen qualified inputs\nPermission clauses / profile · retained binary / runtime\nVerifier / recipes / fixtures / independent observations"
Rehearse: "Same retained fixed packaging composition\nParser / constants / admission / coordinator / adapters\nActual Taskfile edges, sealed pure context"
Gate: "Always-present contact gate\nCheck fixed requested intent before scratch mapping\nPure context cannot issue live contact permission"
Scratch: "Actual scratch pipes / descriptors / CF bytes\nNo mdfind or installed-root positive\nIntent evidence is distinct from actual scratch contact"
Observer: "External Darwin DTrace candidate\nProcess tree / syscall entry + return / fd association\nDirect-syscall bypass control; capability UNESTABLISHED"
Oracle: "Independent expectations\nFormat-derived vs native-corroborated vs regression-only\nCopied producer trees cannot close required facts"
Proof: "Closed per-coordinate proof\nIntended positive / mutation + original observer results\nComplete before / after input and image identities"
Verifier: "Independent admission verifier\nRecompute required set, pairs, provenance and identities\nOne-use invocation-bound channel; no qualified flag"
Boundary: "Refuse any omitted / stale / unavailable coordinate\nAuthority receipt + durable start separately required\nReports / promotion remain outside measured inputs"
Start -> Inputs: "1 · freeze required scope"
Inputs -> Rehearse: "2 · unchanged candidate"
Rehearse -> Gate: "3 · miswire / preflight-bypass controls"
Gate -> Scratch: "4 · allowed scratch contact only"
Scratch -> Observer: "5 · external observation"
Scratch -> Proof: "6a · original actual results"
Observer -> Proof: "6b · no drops / attach gaps / hidden bypass"
Oracle -> Proof: "6c · separately frozen facts"
Proof -> Verifier: "7 · required inventory is independent input"
Start -> Verifier: "7 · missing-proof discrimination"
Verifier -> Boundary: "8 · complete proof alone spends no pass"
